  <div><i>name</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://Άγιος">Άγιος</a> <a href="bword://Βασίλης">Βασίλης</a></div><b>Άιφελ</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(indeclinable) Eiffel</div>
  <div class='ex'>ο Πύργος του <b>Άϊφελ</b> - the Eiffel Tower</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From French Eiffel, pronounced as in German Eiffel, from the surname of (French engineer Gustave Eiffel).</div><b>Άκης</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
