  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Alimos (Athenian neighbourhood)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἅλιμος, from ἅλς.</div><b>Άλινδα</b>
