  <div class='def'>2. (indeclinable) Abu Dhabi (the capital city of the United Arab Emirates; the capital city of Abu Dhabi emirate, United Arab Emirates)</div><b>Άμστερνταμ</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(indeclinable) Amsterdam (the capital city of the Netherlands)</div><b>Άνδεις</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine plural</i></div>
