  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Koine Greek Αὔγουστος, from Latin augustus.</div><b>Αὐστραλία</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Katharevousa form of <a href="bword://Αυστραλία">Αυστραλία</a></div><b>Β΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek numeral representing the number two (2), typically romanized as the Roman numeral II.</div>
