  <div class='def'>1. (indeclinable) Gamaliel</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (indeclinable) a male given name, Gamaliil, from Hebrew, equivalent to English Gamaliel</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Koine Greek Γαμαλιήλ from Aramaic גַמַלִיאיֵל from Biblical Hebrew גַּמְלִיאֵל. Compare Classical Syriac ܓ݂ܰܡܰܠܺܝܐܝܶܠ.</div><b>Γανυμήδης</b>
