  <div><i>name</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. ELAS (Ελληνικός Λαϊκός Απελευθερωτικός Στρατός); the Greek People&#x27;s Liberation Army, the military arm of the left-wing National Liberation Front (<a href="bword://ΕΑΜ">ΕΑΜ</a>) during the period of the Greek Resistance until February 1945</div>
  <div class='def'>2. Acronym of Ελληνική Αστυνομία (ΕΛληνική ΑΣτυνομία); the Hellenic Police.</div>
  <div class='ex'>Often written as ΕΛ.ΑΣ.</div><b>ΕΛΟΤ</b>
