  <div class='def'>2. (Greek) Zeus</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek Ζεύς, from Proto-Hellenic *dzéus, from Proto-Indo-European *dyew-.</div><b>Ζιάζιακος</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
