  <div><i>name, masculine plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Edoni.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek Ἠδωνοί.</div><b>Ηλέκτρα</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine</i></div>
