  <div class='def'>2. Electra, one of the stars in the Pleiades star cluster.</div>
  <div class='def'>3. a female given name, Ilektra, equivalent to English Electra</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Ἠλέκτρα.</div><b>Ηλίας</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>a male given name, Elias, from Hebrew, equivalent to English Elias or Elijah</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Ἠλίᾱς, from Biblical Hebrew אֱלִיָּה.</div><b>Ηλύσια Πεδία</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter plural</i></div>
