  <div><i>name, feminine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>United Nations, UN</div><b>Ηνωμένα Αραβικά Εμιράτα</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>United Arab Emirates (a country in West Asia in the Middle East)</div><b>Ηνωμένες Πολιτείες</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>United States (a country in North America)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Calque of English United States.</div><b>Ηνωμένες Πολιτείες Αμερικής</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>short for Ηνωμένες Πολιτείες <a href="bword://της">της</a> Αμερικής</div><b>Ηνωμένες Πολιτείες της Αμερικής</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>United States of America (a country in North America)</div><b>Ηνωμένο Βασίλειο</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>United Kingdom (a kingdom and country in Northern Europe)</div><b>Ηνωμένων Πολιτειών</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>genitive plural of Ηνωμένες Πολιτείες</div><b>Ηράκλειο</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. Heraklion (the capital of the regional unit of Heraklion and of the region of Crete, Greece)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. Heraklion (a regional unit in central Crete, Greece)</div>
  <div class='def'>3. Irakleio (a municipality of North Athens regional unit, Attica, Greece; a suburb of Athens)</div>
  <div class='def'>4. Irakleio (a village and community in the municipality of Lagkadas, Thessaloniki regional unit, Central Macedonia, Greece)</div>
  <div class='def'>5. Irakleio (a village in the municipality of Nemea, Corinthia regional unit, Peloponnese, Greece)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek Ἡράκλειον, from Ἡρακλῆς.</div><b>Ηράκλειτος</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
