  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Ἡράκλειτος.</div><b>Ηρακλής</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (Greek) Heracles</div>
  <div class='def'>2. the constellation Hercules</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Ἡρακλῆς, apparently from Ἥρα + κλέος.</div><b>Ηριδανός</b>
