  <div class='def'>2. a male given name, Irodotos, equivalent to English Herodotus</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek Ἡρόδοτος.</div><b>Ησίοδος</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
