  <div class='def'>a male given name, equivalent to English Thomas</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Θωμᾶς, from Aramaic תאומא (ta&#x27;wma), from Biblical Hebrew תְּאוֹם.</div><b>Ι.Κ.Α.</b>
  <div><i>name</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://ΙΚΑ">ΙΚΑ</a> (IKA)</div><b>Ι΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek numeral representing the number ten (10), typically romanized as the Roman numeral X.</div>
  <div class='ex'>Ο Αλφόνσος Ιʹ (1221–1284) ήταν ένας μονάρχης, βασιλιάς της Λεόν και Καστίλλης-Γαλικίας από το 1252 μέχρι τον θάνατό του.
Alfonso X (1221–1284) was a monarch, king of Leon and Castille–Galicia from 1252 until his death.</div><b>ΙΑ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek numeral representing the number eleven (11), typically romanized as the Roman numeral XI.</div>
  <div class='ex'>Ο Κωνσταντῖνος <b>ΙΑ’</b> Δραγάσης Παλαιολόγος (1404 - 1453), ορθότερα Κωνσταντίνος ΙΒ’, ήταν ο τελευταίος βασιλεύων Βυζαντινός αυτοκράτορας από το 1449 έως το θάνατό του κατά την Άλωση της Κωνσταντινούπολης. - Constantine XI Dragaš Palaeologus (1404–1453), also known as Constantine XII, was the last ruling Byzantine emperor from 1449 to his death during the Fall of Constantinople.</div><b>ΙΗ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek number representing the number eighteen or 18.</div><b>ΙΘ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek number representing the number nineteen or 19.</div><b>ΙΚΑ</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>initialism of Ίδρυμα Κοινωνικών Ασφαλίσεων: Social Insurance Institute of Greece, from 1934 to 2017.</div>
  <div class='ex'>substituted by ΕΦΚΑ (EFKA) since 2017.</div><b>ΙΣ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://ΙΣΤ΄">ΙΣΤ΄</a></div><b>ΙΣΤ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek numeral representing the number sixteen (16), typically romanized as the Roman numeral XVI.</div><b>ΙΣτ΄</b>
