  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Ionian (sea in the eastern Mediterranean)</div><b>Ιόνιο πέλαγος</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Ionian Sea, area southwest of Greece</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Hellenistic Koine Greek Ἰόνιον πέλαγος, from Ancient Greek Ἰόνιος θάλασσα f or Ἰόνιος πόντος m or just Ἰόνιον . From Ἰόνιος, traditionally related to Ἰώ who swam through it, of unknown etymon and πέλαγος.</div><b>Ιώ</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine (proper)</i></div>
