  <div><i>name, masculine (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (indeclinable) a male given name, Iov, from Hebrew, equivalent to English Job</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (indeclinable) Job (Old Testament character and book in the Bible)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek Ἰώβ, from Biblical Hebrew אִיּוֹב.</div><b>ΙϚ΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
