  <div class='def'>2. (indeclinable) Republic of the Congo (a country in Central Africa, smaller and to the west of the Democratic Republic of the Congo)</div>
  <div class='def'>3. (indeclinable) Congo (a major river in Central Africa which flows for about 4,380 km (2,720 miles) to the Atlantic Ocean in the Democratic Republic of the Congo, at times forming the border with the Republic of the Congo and Angola)</div>
  <div class='ex'>ο ποταμός <b>Κονγκό</b> - the river Congo</div>
