  <div><i>name, masculine or feminine (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(indeclinable) a surname from Armenian</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from Armenian Մելիքյան (Melikʻyan).</div><b>Μενέλαος</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
