  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Missolonghi (large town in Aetolia-Acarnania in Greece)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Italian Messolaghi, from messo (“put in”) laghi (“lakes”).</div><b>Μεσοπροτεροζωικός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (uncountable)</i></div>
