  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural Μολδαβοί, feminine Μολδαβή)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Moldavan, Moldavian (a person, usually male, from Moldova or of Moldavian ethnicity).</div><b>Μολούκες</b>
