  <div class='def'>Moluccas (an archipelago of Indonesia)</div><b>Μονακό</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(indeclinable) Monaco (a city-state in Western Europe)</div><b>Μονεγάσκος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural Μονεγάσκοι)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Monegasque (a person from Monaco or of Monegasque ethnicity).</div><b>Μονομάχος</b>
  <div><i>name, masculine</i></div>
