  <div class='ex'>(historical) notably borne by Κωνσταντίνος ο Μονομάχος (Konstantínos o Monomáchos), Constantine IX Monomachos (c. 1000–1055 CE), Byzantine Roman Emperor who ruled the Byzantine Empire from 1042 to 1055</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek Μονομάχος.</div><b>Μονσεράτ</b>
