  <div class='def'>Hiroshima (the capital city of Hiroshima Prefecture, Japan)</div><b>Χλεμποτσάρι</b>
  <div><i>name, neuter</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(historical) synonym of <a href="bword://Ασωπία">Ασωπία</a></div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from Albanian Glliboçari. Said to be from Slavic terms derived from *xlě̀bъ (bread) and *cěsařь (“tsar”), with the assumption that the village was previously used to make bread for a Slavic tsar.</div><b>Χλόη</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine</i></div>
