  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Probably a borrowing from Ancient Greek ἄροτρον, from Proto-Indo-European *h₂érh₃trom. Doublet of αλέτρι, inherited through a diminutive form.</div><b>άρπα</b>
