  <div class='def'>4. unseemly</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἄσχημος, from Ancient Greek ἀσχήμων. By surface analysis, α- (a-) + σχήμα + -ος (-os), compositionally equivalent to English unshapely.</div><b>άσωστοι υιοί</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine</i></div>
