  <div class='def'>3. to offend, hurt</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Byzantine Greek ἀγγίζω from Hellenistic Koine Greek ἐγγίζω, from Ancient Greek ἐγγύς.</div><b>αγγαρεία</b>
