  <div class='def'>1. shackle</div>
  <div class='def'>2. shackle (U-shaped piece of metal, as in a padlock)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Koine Greek ἀγκύλιον.</div><b>αγκύλος</b>
