  <div class='def'>1. curved</div>
  <div class='def'>2. hook shaped</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀγκῠ́λος.</div><b>αγκύλωμα</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural αγκυλώματα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. sting, stinging, prickle (an effect)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) pang</div><b>αγκύλωση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αγκυλώσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>ankylosis, anchylosis</div><b>αγκύριο</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural αγκύρια)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>grapnel, small anchor</div><b>αγκώνας</b>
