  <div class='def'>1. elbow</div>
  <div class='def'>2. bend, curve</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek ἀγκώνας, from Ancient Greek ἀγκών, through the singular accusative τόν ἀγκῶνα.</div><b>αγκώνω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>bloated, distended (eg stomach)</div><b>αγλάισμα</b>
