  <div class='def'>pride, glory</div><b>αγλέουρας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αγκλέορας">αγκλέορας</a></div><b>αγλέωρας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αγκλέορας">αγκλέορας</a></div><b>αγλαΐζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to adorn, brighten</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) to heap praise upon someone</div><b>αγλαός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αγλαή, neuter αγλαό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. brilliant, shining</div>
  <div class='def'>2. splendid, shining</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀγλαός.</div><b>αγλωσσία</b>
