  <div class='def'>(uncountable) agnosticism, the doctrine of agnostics</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From English agnosticism, a Greek-derived term invented by Thomas Henry Huxley in 1869. First attested in Greek, 1888.</div><b>αγνωστικιστής</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αγνωστικιστές, feminine αγνωστικίστρια)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>agnostic</div>
