  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Koine Greek ἀδιαφορία from ἀδιάφορος, ancient sense: &quot;not different&quot; See ἀ- privative (a- privative) &amp; διαφέρω.</div><b>αδιαφοροποίητος</b>
