  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to be indifferent to, not care about</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Koine Greek ἀδιαφορῶ, contracted form of ἀδιαφορέω from the ancient ἀδιάφορος.</div><b>αδιαφόρετα</b>
