  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly, from Hellenistic Koine Greek αἰφνίδιος, from αἴφνης</div><b>αιφνιδίως</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αιφνίδια">αιφνίδια</a></div><b>αιφνιδιάζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to surprise</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to take by surprise, take unawares</div><b>αιφνιδιασμός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αιφνιδιασμοί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. surprise</div>
  <div class='def'>2. surprise attack, spot check</div><b>αιφνιδιαστικά</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>by surprise, unexpectedly</div><b>αιφνιδιαστικός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αιφνιδιαστική, neuter αιφνιδιαστικό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>surprise, unexpected</div><b>αιχμάλωτος</b>
