  <div class='def'>1. sharp, pointed, nosed</div>
  <div class='def'>2. jagged, spiky</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From αιχμή.</div><b>αιχμηρότητα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (uncountable) sharpness</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively, uncountable) sharpness</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αιχμηρός + -ότητα. First attested 1872.</div><b>αιωνίως</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>eternally, forever, everlastingly</div><b>αιωνιότητα</b>
