  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αιωροπτερισμοί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>hang gliding</div><b>αιωροπτεριστής</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αιωροπτεριστές, feminine αιωροπτερίστρια)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>hang glider (the pilot)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αιωρόπτερο + -ιστής, calque of English hang glider.</div><b>αιωρούμαι</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to hover</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to hang, swing</div>
  <div class='def'>3. (figuratively) to waver, swing, be undecided</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek αἰωροῦμαι, medio-passive voice of αἰωρέω.</div><b>αιωρόπτερο</b>
