  <div class='def'>hang glider (the aircraft)</div><b>αιωρώ</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(rare) to soar (in the air)</div><b>αιώνας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αιώνες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. century (100 consecutive years)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. century (specifically a numbered period with conventional start)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Έγινε στα μέσα του 20ου <b>αιώνα</b>. - It took place in the middle of the 20th century.</div>
  <div class='def'>3. eon, era, age</div>
  <div class='ex'>Φανεροζωικός <b>αιώνας</b> - Phanerozoic eon</div>
  <div class='def'>4. eternity, age, eon</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek αἰών.</div><b>αιώνια</b>
