  <div class='def'>1. nominative/accusative/vocative feminine singular of <a href="bword://αιώνιος">αιώνιος</a></div>
  <div class='def'>2. nominative/accusative/vocative neuter plural of <a href="bword://αιώνιος">αιώνιος</a></div><b>αιώνιο</b>
