  <div class='def'>1. still to bear fruit, not yet started to bear fruit</div>
  <div class='def'>2. barren, fruitless</div><b>ακάρφωτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακάρφωτη, neuter ακάρφωτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. not nailed, unnailed</div>
  <div class='def'>2. not rivetted, unrivetted</div><b>ακάτεχος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακάτεχη, neuter ακάτεχο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. ignorant (lacking knowledge)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. unsuspecting, unaware</div><b>ακάτιο</b>
