  <div class='def'>3. prong, pin (of an electrical plug for an outlet)</div>
  <div class='def'>4. front sight post (the center post of iron sights used for aiming a weapon or in a primitive finder sight for optical telescopes, range finders, etc.)</div>
  <div class='def'>5. (abbreviation, acronym) Independent Movement of Kindergarten Teachers (movement started in 1992 in Greece, acronym written as <a href="bword://Α">Α</a>.Κί.Δ.<a href="bword://Α">Α</a>.)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek ἀκίς.</div><b>ακίνδυνα</b>
