  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural ακονίσματα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>sharpener, grinder (tool)</div><b>ακονιστής</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural ακονιστές)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>sharpener, grinder (occupation)</div><b>ακονιστικός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακονιστική, neuter ακονιστικό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>relating to sharpening and grinding</div><b>ακοντίζω</b>
