  <div class='def'>3. unwearied</div>
  <div class='def'>4. idle</div><b>ακορνίζωτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακορνίζωτη, neuter ακορνίζωτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. unframed, without a frame/border</div>
  <div class='def'>2. uncorniced, without a cornice</div><b>ακορνιζάριστος</b>
