  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακορφολόγητη, neuter ακορφολόγητο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. uncropped, unsnipped, not nipped off</div>
  <div class='def'>2. not pinched out</div><b>ακορόιδευτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακορόιδευτη, neuter ακορόιδευτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. not laughed at, unmocked, not ridiculed, not scoffed at, not derided</div>
  <div class='def'>2. undeceived, not fooled, unfooled</div><b>ακορύφωτος</b>
