  <div class='def'>1. has not reached a high point, head or climax (events)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. has not reached a climax or orgasm (sex)</div><b>ακοσκίνιστος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ακοσκίνιστη, neuter ακοσκίνιστο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>unsieved, unsifted, ungraded, unbolted</div>
  <div class='ex'><b>ακοσκίνιστο</b> αλεύρι - wholemeal (unsifted) flour</div><b>ακοσμία</b>
