  <div class='def'>conceited, haughty, arrogant</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly, from Ancient Greek ἀλαζονικός, from ἀλαζών, stem ἀλαζον- + -ικός.</div><b>αλαζόνας</b>
