  <div class='def'>2. to ululate</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἀλαλάζω, onomatopoeic from the ancient cry &#x27;alala&#x27;. Unrelated to αλαλιάζω and similar words from λαλώ.</div><b>αλαλία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
