  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αλαλαγή">αλαλαγή</a></div><b>αλαλητός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αλαλητοί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of αλαλητό</div><b>αλαλιάζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (transitive) to stupify, stun, daze</div>
