  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to help each other, help one another</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αλληλο- (allilo-, “reciprocal, mutual”) + βοηθιέμαι</div><b>αλληλοβρίζομαι</b>
