  <div class='def'>(uncountable) madness, frenzy</div><b>αλλοχωριανός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αλλοχωριανή, neuter αλλοχωριανό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>from another village</div><b>αλλού</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. elsewhere; somewhere else, someplace else (in or at some other place or places)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Όχι, δεν είναι εδώ. Βρίσκεται <b>αλλού</b>. - No, he&#x27;s not here. He&#x27;s somewhere else.</div>
  <div class='def'>2. elsewhere; somewhere else, someplace else (to some other place)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Αυτοί θα πάνε στην Πάτρα ενώ εμείς θα πάμε <b>αλλού</b>. - They&#x27;ll go to Patras while we&#x27;ll go someplace else.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek ἀλλοῦ, from Ancient Greek ἄλλος following the model of πάντα → παντοῦ.</div><b>αλλού τα κακαρίσματα κι αλλού γεννούν οι κότες</b>
  <div><i>proverb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>talk is cheap (it is easy to make boastful or unrealistic statements which never come true)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Literal translation: &#x27;&quot;The squawking is in one place and the hens give birth in another.&quot;</div><b>αλλούθε</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to another place, from another direction, in another direction</div><b>αλλόδοξος</b>
