  <div class='def'>1. slightly salty</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) a bit expensive</div><b>αλμυρός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αλμυρή, neuter αλμυρό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. salty, briny</div>
  <div class='def'>2. savoury, not sweet, unsweet</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἁλμυρός, from ἅλς.</div><b>αλμυρότητα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) saltiness, salinity</div><b>αλμύρα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αλμύρες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>saltiness, salinity</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek ἁλμύρα.</div><b>αλογάριαστος</b>
