  <div class='def'>3. cranefly, daddy longlegs</div>
  <div class='def'>4. mantis, praying mantis</div><b>αλογατάρης</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αλογατάρηδες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. horseman, ostler, stableman</div>
  <div class='def'>2. horse dealer</div><b>αλογονουρά</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αλογονουρές)</i></div>
