  <div class='def'>1. tail of a horse</div>
  <div class='def'>2. ponytail (hairstyle)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αλογο (alogo, “horse”) + ουρά</div><b>αλογοπάζαρο</b>
