  <div class='def'>horsefly (flies of the family Tabanidae that suck the blood of mammals)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Όταν πήγαμε να κολυμπήσουμε στη λίμνη, μας τσιμπούσαν <b>αλογόμυγες</b>. - When we went to go swimming in the lake, horseflies were biting us.</div>
