  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αλυχτώ">αλυχτώ</a></div><b>αλυχτώ</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to bark, woof</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ὑλακτῶ) with metathesis.</div><b>αλφάβητον</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural αλφάβητα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Katharevousa form of αλφάβητο</div>
