  <div class='def'>undarned (of woven cloth - unrepaired)</div><b>αμαντήλωτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αμαντήλωτη, neuter αμαντήλωτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>without a headscarf, headscarfless</div><b>αμαξάδα</b>
