  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>imperceptibly, unperceived</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From adjective ανεπαίσθητος and from Hellenistic ἀνεπαισθήτως.</div><b>ανεπαίσθητος</b>
