  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural ανευφημήσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>cheering (action and effect)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Katharevousa ἀνευφήμισις with modern ending -ση. From the Ancient verb ἀνευφημέω / ἀνευφημῶ (stem ἀν-ευ-φημη-) + -σις (suffix for feminine nouns).</div><b>ανευφημία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine</i></div>
