  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://ανιψιός">ανιψιός</a></div><b>ανεόρταστα</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>uncelebrated (feast/name day)</div><b>ανεόρταστος</b>
