  <div class='def'>worrying, concerning, disquieting, troubling, alarming, disturbing (causing worry, anxiety)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly from the ανησυχη- stem of ανησυχώ + -τικός, a calque of French inquiétant.</div><b>ανησυχώ</b>
