  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://ανηψιά">ανηψιά</a></div><b>ανθ&#x27;</b>
  <div><i>prep</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of αντ’ (ant’))</div><b>ανθ.</b>
  <div><i>noun</i></div>
  <div class='def'>abbreviation of <a href="bword://ανθοκομία">ανθοκομία</a>: floriculture</div><b>ανθέλληνας</b>
