  <div class='def'>(derogatory, formal) anti-Greek, Greek hater, mishellene (someone who hates or works against the interests of Greece or Greeks)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Πόλοι είπανε τον πρωθυπουργό «<b>ανθέλληνα</b>» επειδή κατά την γνώμη τους, πρόδωσε την Μακεδονία. - Many called the Prime Minister a ‘Greek hater’ because, in their opinions, he had betrayed Macedonia.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> ανθ- (anth-, “anti-, un-”) + Έλληνας</div><b>ανθέμιο</b>
