  <div class='def'>2. anthemion</div>
  <div class='def'>3. anthem</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀνθέμιον, from Ancient Greek ἄνθεμον.</div><b>ανθήρας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural ανθήρες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>anther</div><b>ανθί</b>
