  <div class='def'>1. flower festival</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (as a proper noun) Anthesteria (the Athenian festival)</div><b>ανθηρός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ανθηρή, neuter ανθηρό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. blooming, flowering, flowery</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) blooming, flourishing</div>
