  <div class='def'>(uncountable) floriculture</div><b>ανθοκράμβη</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural ανθοκράμβες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncommon) cauliflower</div><b>ανθοκόμος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine or feminine (plural ανθοκόμοι)</i></div>
