  <div class='def'>2. (broadly) florist</div><b>ανθολογία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural ανθολογίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>anthology</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀνθολογία.</div><b>ανθολογώ</b>
