  <div class='def'>(neologism) anthropause</div>
  <div class='ex'>Αυτή η χρονιά θα μείνει στη σύγχρονη ιστορία ως το πρώτο έτος της Μεγάλης Παύσης ή <b>Ανθρωπόπαυσης</b> (Anthropause), όπως έχει καθιερωθεί πλέον ο όρος. - This year will go down in modern history as the first year of the Great Pause or Anthropause as the term is now established.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> ανθρωπό- + παύση. A calque of English anthropause as anthro(po)-pause. The term, concerning COVID&#x27;s impact, was used since 2020; in Greek, by Christos Zerefos, professor of Atmospheric Physics</div><b>ανθρωπότητα</b>
