  <div class='def'>2. deranged, insane, psychotic, psycho, (idiomatic): crackpot, mad as a hatter, bonkers, maladjusted, unstable, barking mad, loony, has a screw loose, not playing with a full deck, nuts, nuttier than squirrel poop, off one&#x27;s rocker, lost one&#x27;s marbles, smoking crack, lost it (the mind), lost one&#x27;s mind</div>
  <div class='def'>3. imbalanced (much less common)</div><b>ανισότητα</b>
