  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>nominative/accusative/vocative neuter plural of <a href="bword://ανώμαλος">ανώμαλος</a></div><b>ανώμαλος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ανώμαλη, neuter ανώμαλο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. abnormal</div>
