  <div class='def'>2. to decalcify (remove calcium)</div><b>απασπάλιστος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine απασπάλιστή, neuter απασπάλιστο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>unpowdered, unsprinkled, not sprinkled</div><b>απασπάτευτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine απασπάτευτη, neuter απασπάτευτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. untouched, not groped</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) virgin</div><b>απαστράπτω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(no past) to sparkle, flash, gleam</div><b>απαστράπτων</b>
