  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to threaten, menace, intimidate</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly, from Ancient Greek ἀπειλῶ, contracted form of ἀπειλέω.</div><b>απειράγαθος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine απειράγαθη, neuter απειράγαθο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>infinitely good</div><b>απειράκις</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>infinitely, many times</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀπειράκις, from ἄπειρος.</div><b>απειράριθμος</b>
