  <div class='ex'><b>απεκδύομαι</b> των ευθυνών μου - I wash my hands of my responsibilities</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly, from Hellenistic Koine Greek ἀπεκδύομαι, also with figurative sense. Morphologically, απ- (ap-) + εκδύω in the passive voice with -ομαι (-omai) ending.</div><b>απεκκρίνω</b>
