  <div class='def'>1. (historical) freed, emancipated (from serfdom, slavery, etc)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. a freed person</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀ̆πελεύθερος.</div><b>απελπίζομαι</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to despair</div><b>απελπίζω</b>
