  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to bring about, cause, beget</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) to scheme, conspire</div><b>απεργία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural απεργίες)</i></div>
