  <div class='def'>2. (transitive) to deregulate</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly from απο- (apo-) + δεσμεύω, a calque of French dégager, désengager and German entbinden. Compare Ancient Greek ἀποδεσμεύω.</div><b>αποδεχτός</b>
