  <div class='ex'>standard form: πεθαμένος (pethaménos)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Perfect passive participle of αποθαίνω, form of πεθαίνω, both verbσ with no passive forms. Inherited from Byzantine Greek ἀποθαμένος.</div><b>αποθανάτιση</b>
