  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αποσαφηνίσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>clarification, disambiguation, removal of ambiguity</div><b>αποσαφηνίζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to clarify, disambiguate</div><b>αποσβένω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
