  <div class='ex'>Polytonic spelling: ἀποσείομαι</div><b>αποσείω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to shake off, refute</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀποσείω (“shake off”).</div><b>αποσιωπητικά</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>ellipsis, suspension points</div><b>αποσιωπτήρας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αποσιωπτήρες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. silencer</div>
  <div class='def'>2. muffler peddle</div><b>αποσιωπώ</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to suppress, hush up</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly, from Ancient Greek ἀποσιωπῶ, contracted form of ἀποσῐωπάω from ἀπό + σιωπῶ. By surface analysis, απο- (apo-) + σιωπώ</div><b>αποσιώπηση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αποσιωπήσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>suppression, hushing up, concealment</div>
