  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to be sent</div><b>αποστέλλω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to send, remit, ship, dispatch, consign</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἀποστέλλω. Morphologically, from απο- (“from”) + the ancient στέλλω (“send”)</div><b>αποστέλνω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
