  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to sterilise (UK), sterilize (US), to pasteurise (UK), pasteurize (US)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Hellenistic Koine Greek ἀποστειρῶ, contracted form of ἀποστειρόω + -ώνω. By surface analysis, απο- (apo-) + στειρώνω.</div><b>αποστεριόρι</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
