  <div class='def'>1. irrefutable, unanswerable</div>
  <div class='def'>2. disarming</div><b>αποστομώνω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(transitive) to silence, make silent, overawe</div><b>αποστράγγιση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αποστραγγίσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>drainage, draining, ditch</div><b>αποστράγγισμα</b>
