  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αποστρατεύσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>demobilisation (UK), demobilization (US), retirement (the process)</div><b>αποστρέφομαι</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to loathe, to abominate</div><b>αποστρέφω</b>
