  <div class='def'>1. to avert (one&#x27;s gaze), to turn away towards a different direction</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to loathe</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀποστρέφω. By surface analysis, απο- (apo-) + στρέφω.</div><b>αποστραβώνω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to deform, distort, disable</div>
