  <div class='def'>1. anchored, moored</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) at rest</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Perfect passive participle of αράζω</div><b>αραδιάζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (transitive) to line up, to organise (UK), organize (US)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to arrange, enumerate</div><b>αραδιαστός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αραδιαστή, neuter αραδιαστό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>arranged in rows</div><b>αραθυμιά</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αραθυμιές)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. colloquial form of αραθυμία:; irritability, tetchiness</div>
  <div class='def'>2. colloquial form of αραθυμία:; longing</div><b>αραθυμώ</b>
