  <div class='def'>1. to dilute, thin, spread out</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to reduce (in number)</div><b>αρακάς</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (uncountable) pea, peas (vegetable)</div>
