  <div class='def'>1. army boot, hobnail boot</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) rumour (UK), rumor (US)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀρβύλη</div><b>αργά</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. slowly</div>
  <div class='def'>2. late</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αργός + -α (-a).</div>
  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>nominative/accusative/vocative neuter plural of <a href="bword://αργός">αργός</a></div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αργός + -α (-a).</div><b>αργάζω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (transitive) to tan (leather)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) to tan, beat</div><b>αργή κίνηση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) slow motion</div><b>αργία</b>
