  <div class='ex'>Άσε μας, βρε <b>αρχίδι</b>! - Leave us alone, you dickhead!</div>
  <div class='def'>3. (offensive, vulgar) my ass</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek ὀρχίδιον, from Ancient Greek ὄρχις. The change of the initial vowel from ο to α is due to the liaison from the plural: τὰ ὀρχίδια → (elision) τὰ ’ρχίδια → (rebracketing) τ’ ἀρχίδια.</div><b>αρχίζω</b>
