  <div class='def'>initial, original</div>
  <div class='ex'><b>αρχικό</b> κεφάλαιο - principal, initial investment</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀρχικός.</div><b>αρχικώς</b>
