  <div class='def'>chief accountant</div><b>αρχιλοχίας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine or feminine (plural αρχιλοχίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>warrant officer class 2, company sergeant major (the NATO military rank OR-8)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αρχι- (archi-, “first”) + λοχίας.</div><b>αρχιλόχειος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αρχιλόχειη, neuter αρχιλόχειος)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. Archilochian, of or pertaining to the Classical Greek poet Archilochus</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) biting, stinging</div><b>αρχιμάγειρας</b>
