  <div class='def'>1. (dated) A naval rank with the NATO grade OF-10 (obsolete in the Greek navy); admiral of the fleet in the Royal Navy</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (dated) A naval rank with the NATO grade OF-10 (obsolete in the Greek navy); fleet admiral in the US navy</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From αρχι- (archi-) + ναύαρχος.</div><b>αρχινοσοκόμα</b>
