  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αρχιραββίνοι)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(Judaism) chief rabbi (minister of religion)</div><b>αρχισμηνίας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine or feminine (plural αρχισμηνίες)</i></div>
