  <div class='def'>1. seeking high office, flattery of such people</div>
  <div class='def'>2. such a person</div><b>αρχολιπαρία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (countable and uncountable, plural αρχολιπαρίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(countable, uncountable) sucking up, flattery (for personal gain)</div><b>αρχομανής</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αρχομανής, neuter αρχομανές)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>power hungry, power thirsty</div><b>αρχομανία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural αρχομανίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) lust for power</div><b>αρχοντάνθρωπος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αρχοντάνθρωποι, feminine αρχοντογυναίκα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>patrician, gentleman</div><b>αρχοντάρης</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αρχοντάρηδες)</i></div>
