  <div class='def'>observatory</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Katharevousa ἀστεροσκοπ(εῖον), since 1848 + modern suffix -είο. See the Hellenistic ἀστεροσκόπος. By surface analysis, αστέρ(ας)) + -ο- + -σκοπείο. See, form Modern Greek αστέρι n and σκοπός m; for Ancient Greek, ἀστήρ m and σκοπέω.</div><b>αστερόεσσα</b>
  <div><i>name, feminine (plural αστερόεσσες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>the Stars and Stripes</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Ultimately from Ancient Greek ἀστερόεις.</div><b>αστεφάνωτος</b>
