  <div class='def'>3. (figuratively, intransitive) to be very clean</div>
  <div class='def'>4. (figuratively, transitive) to give a slap on the face</div>
  <div class='ex'>Του <b>άστραψα</b> ένα χαστούκι πολύ δυνατό. - I smacked him hard.</div>
