  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) lack of development and/or function</div>
  <div class='ex'>Η <b>ατροφία</b> του κοινωνικού κράτους αντιστοιχεί στην υπερτροφία του ποινικού κράτους. - The lack of development of the welfare state corresponds to the overdevelopment of the criminal state.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἀτροφίᾱ, equivalent to α- (a-, “no, a-”) + τροφή + -ία. The Ancient sense was &#x27;malnutrition&#x27; but the medical sense was attested even then.</div><b>ατροφικός</b>
