  <div class='def'>to act on one&#x27;s own</div><b>αυτεξουσιότητα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural αυτεξουσιότητες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) independence, sovereignty, autonomy</div><b>αυτεξούσιος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αυτεξούσια, neuter αυτεξούσιο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>independent, one&#x27;s own master</div><b>αυτεπάγγελτα</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>ex officio, due to office</div><b>αυτεπάγγελτος</b>
