  <div class='def'>1. self-appointed</div>
  <div class='def'>2. ex officio, appointed due to office</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek αὐτεπάγγελτος</div><b>αυτεπίγνωση</b>
