  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) self-awareness</div><b>αυτεπαγγέλτως</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>ex officio, due to office</div><b>αυτεπαγωγή</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine</i></div>
  <div class='def'>self-inductance, self-induction</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly from αυτ- (aft-) + επαγωγή, a calque of English self-induction.</div><b>αυτεπιστασία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural αυτεπιστασία)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) self-build, self-construction</div><b>αυτηνής</b>
