  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural αυτιστικά)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>autist, an autistic person</div>
  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. accusative masculine singular of <a href="bword://αυτιστικός">αυτιστικός</a></div>
  <div class='def'>2. nominative/accusative/vocative neuter singular of <a href="bword://αυτιστικός">αυτιστικός</a></div><b>αυτιστικός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αυτιστική, neuter αυτιστικό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>autistic</div><b>αυτοάμυνα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αυτοάμυνες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>self-defence (UK), self-defense (US)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> αυτο- (afto-) + άμυνα, a calque of English self-defence</div><b>αυτοέλεγχος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (usually uncountable, plural αυτοέλεγχοι)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (uncountable, usually) self-control</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (uncountable, usually) self-examination</div><b>αυτοέπαινος</b>
