  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) taking the law into one&#x27;s own hands</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From the Hellenistic Koine verb αὐτοδικῶ/αὐτοδικέω + modern suffix -ία. Attested since 1833 in Katharevousa as αὐτοδικία.</div><b>αυτοδικαίως</b>
