  <div class='def'>self-adjusting, self-regulating</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Present participle of αυτορρυθμίζομαι, passive voice of αυτορρυθμίζω (“to self-regulate”).</div><b>αυτορρύθμιση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (countable and uncountable, plural αυτορρύθμιση)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(countable, uncountable) self-regulation, self-adjustment</div><b>αυτορύθμιση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (countable and uncountable, plural αυτορύθμιση)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αυτορρύθμιση">αυτορρύθμιση</a></div><b>αυτοσεβασμός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) self-respect</div><b>αυτοσκοπός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αυτοσκοποί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>an end in itself</div><b>αυτοστιγμεί</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>instantly, right away</div><b>αυτοσυγκέντρωση</b>
