  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) self-consciousness, self-awareness</div><b>αυτοσυντήρηση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (countable and uncountable, plural αυτοσυντηρήσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(countable, uncountable) self-preservation</div><b>αυτοσυντήρητος</b>
