  <div class='def'>to be self-supporting, to maintain oneself</div><b>αυτοσυστήνομαι</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to introduce oneself, to present yourself</div><b>αυτοσυσταίνομαι</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αυτοσυστήνομαι">αυτοσυστήνομαι</a></div><b>αυτοσχέδιος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αυτοσχέδια, neuter αυτοσχέδιο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. impromptu, improvised, extemporaneous (speech, song, etc.)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. improvised (device, mechanism, etc.)</div>
