  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek σχεδιάζω</div><b>αυτοσχεδιασμός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αυτοσχεδιασμοί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>improvisation, extemporisation (UK), extemporization (US)</div><b>αυτοτέλεια</b>
