  <div class='def'>to self-finance, to self-fund</div><b>αυτοχρηματοδότηση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural αυτοχρηματοδότηση)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) self-financing, self-funding</div><b>αυτοψία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αυτοψίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>postmortem, autopsy</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Koine Greek αὐτοψία</div><b>αυτοψηλάφηση</b>
