  <div class='def'>handwritten, in/by one&#x27;s own hand</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek αὐτόγραφος.</div><b>αυτόδηλος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αυτόδηλη, neuter αυτόδηλο)</i></div>
