  <div class='def'>billposter, billsticker, flyposter</div><b>αφισοκολλώ</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to flypost, to fix posters, to stick bills</div><b>αφισοκόλληση</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural αφισοκολλήσεις)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) billposting, flyposting</div><b>αφιχθείς</b>
