  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Byzantine Greek ἀφιόνι(ον)), a medieval αντιδάνειο, from Ottoman Turkish آفیون (afyon, “opium”), ultimately a reborrowing from Ancient Greek ὄπιον.</div><b>αφιόνισμα</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (usually uncountable, plural αφιονίσματα)</i></div>
