  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. to disarm; to defuse</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to disarm; to take weapons away</div>
  <div class='def'>3. to unrig, to dismantle</div>
  <div class='def'>4. (figuratively) to make harmless</div><b>αφοπλισμός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural αφοπλισμοί)</i></div>
