  <div class='def'>to skirmish</div><b>αψιμυθίωτος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine αψιμυθίωτη, neuter αψιμυθίωτο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>without makeup</div><b>αψινθιά</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural αψινθιές)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://αψιθιά">αψιθιά</a></div><b>αψού</b>
