  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from Italian barilotto (“little barrel”).</div><b>βαρετός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine βαρετή, neuter βαρετό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>boring, tiresome</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From βάρος + -τος (-tos, suffix forming adjectives).</div><b>βαριά</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural βαριές)</i></div>
