  <div class='def'>1. (literally, rare, uncountable, usually) bibliophagy; the act of book-eating; occasionally said of certain insects such as psocopterans or other literal bookworms.</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively, uncountable, usually) bookwormism, bibliophily, bibliophagy; avid reading or love of books.</div>
