  <div><i>noun, masculine (usually uncountable, plural ημιμορφίτες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) hemimorphite</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Internationalism. By surface analysis, ημι- (imi-, “hemi-, half”) + μορφή + -ίτης.</div><b>ημιορόφου</b>
