  <div class='def'>mezzanine, entresol, an intermediate floor just above ground level</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> ημι- (imi-, “semi-, half”) + -ώροφος, from όροφος m, a calque of German Halbgeschoß</div><b>ηνωμένος</b>
