  <div class='def'>2. rest, tranquility, peace, serenity</div>
  <div class='def'>3. quietness</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Ancient Greek ἠρεμῐ́ᾱ.</div><b>ηρεμιστικό</b>
