  <div class='def'>3. (transitive) to calm down, to calm, to make calm</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἠρεμῶ, ἠρεμέω.</div><b>ηρωίδα</b>
