  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>to be defeated, to lose</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἡττῶμαι.</div><b>ηυ</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>alternative form of <a href="bword://Η">Η</a>/Υ (I/Y)</div><b>ηφαίστειο</b>
