  <div class='def'>1. volcano</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (figuratively) bombshell (woman:short tempered or highly attractive)</div>
  <div class='def'>3. (figuratively) explosive situation</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Literary loan translation from Romance (French volcan, Italian vulcano), from ancient Greek ἡφαίστειον “belonging to Hephaestus”), scil. ὄρος “mountain” or such.</div><b>ηφαιστειακός</b>
