  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural ηχοσυστήματα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>sound system</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From ηχο- (icho-) + σύστημα, a calque of English sound system.</div><b>ηχόχρωμα</b>
