  <div class='def'>timbre</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> ήχος + χρώμα.</div><b>ηχώ</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(singular only, uncountable) echo, reflected sound</div>
