  <div class='ex'>Τα τύμπανα <b>ηχούσαν</b> όλη τη νύχτα. - The drums sounded all night.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἠχῶ, the contracted form of ἠχέω.</div><b>ηωαρχαιοζωικός</b>
