  <div class='def'>1. to bury, inter</div>
  <div class='def'>2. to conceal, hide</div>
  <div class='def'>3. to ruin</div>
  <div class='def'>4. to criticize, slander or gossip</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Inherited from Byzantine Greek θάβω, from the Ancient Greek θάπτω from the perfective stem θαψ- in the pattern of -ψ- &gt; -β- as in κόπτω, κοψ- &gt; κόβω.</div><b>θάλαμος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural θάλαμοι)</i></div>
