  <div class='def'>3. compartment, cabin</div>
  <div class='def'>4. thalamus (brain)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek θάλαμος.</div><b>θάλαμος αερίων</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural θάλαμοι αερίων)</i></div>
