  <div class='def'>ideal</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From ιδέα + -ώδης. Calque of French idéal.</div><b>ιδιαίτερα</b>
  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. nominative neuter plural of <a href="bword://ιδιαίτερος">ιδιαίτερος</a></div>
  <div class='def'>2. accusative neuter plural of <a href="bword://ιδιαίτερος">ιδιαίτερος</a></div>
  <div class='def'>3. vocative neuter plural of <a href="bword://ιδιαίτερος">ιδιαίτερος</a></div>
  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>particularly, in particular, especially</div>
  <div class='ex'>Μου αρέσουν οι ταινίες και <b>ιδιαίτερα</b> οι ταινίες τρόμου. - I like movies and especially horror movies.</div><b>ιδιαίτερος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ιδιαίτερη, neuter ιδιαίτερο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. special</div>
  <div class='def'>2. particular</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek ἰδιαίτερος, comparative degree of ἴδιος.</div><b>ιδιαιτέρως</b>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(formal) particularly, in particular, especially</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἰδιαίτερος, comparative of ἴδιος with the adverb ending -ως.</div><b>ιδιαιτερότητα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural ιδιαιτερότητες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. particularity, peculiarity, singularity (the state of being particular, peculiar, singular, distinct)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. particularity, peculiarity, specific feature (a distinctive characteristic or quality)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly from ιδιαίτερ(ος)) + -ότητα.</div><b>ιδιογλωσσία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (usually uncountable, plural ιδιογλωσσίες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable, usually) jargon, lingo</div><b>ιδιοδεκτικότητα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
