  <div class='def'>proprietor, owner</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned formation from ιδιο- (idio-) + -κτήτης), formed as a calque of German Eigenbesitzer.</div><b>ιδιοκτήτρια</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural ιδιοκτήτριες, masculine ιδιοκτήτης)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>proprietress, proprietor, owner (female)</div><b>ιδιοκτησία</b>
