  <div class='def'>(colloquial, uncountable) body odour, BO (unpleasant smell of sweat)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Έπλυνα τα ρούχα μου επειδή ήταν γεμάτα <b>ιδρωτίλα</b>. - I washed my clothes because they were full of BO.</div>
