  <div class='def'>1. Holy of Holies (Eastern Orthodox church)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. sanctuary, shrine</div>
  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. accusative masculine singular of <a href="bword://ιερός">ιερός</a></div>
  <div class='def'>2. nominative/accusative/vocative neuter singular of <a href="bword://ιερός">ιερός</a></div><b>ιερόδουλη</b>
