  <div class='def'>(euphemistic, formal) prostitute, sex worker (person who engages in sexual activity for payment)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Δύο <b>ιερόδουλες</b> συνελήφθησαν αργά χθες το βράδυ. - Two prostitutes were arrested late last night.</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ἱερόδουλος.</div><b>ιερός</b>
