  <div class='def'>1. sanctified, holy, sacred (of places and things)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (as a neuter noun) shrine, sanctuary</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From the Ancient Greek ἱερός.</div><b>ιη΄</b>
  <div><i>num</i></div>
  <div class='def'>The Greek number representing the number eighteen or 18.</div><b>ιθαγένεια</b>
