  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek κηδεύω.</div><b>κηλίδα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural κηλίδες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. stain, blemish, blot</div>
