  <div class='def'>(uncountable) gardening, horticulture</div><b>κηπευτικός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine κηπευτική, neuter κηπευτικό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>horticultural</div><b>κηπουρική</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) gardening</div><b>κηπουρικός</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine κηπουρική, neuter κηπουρικό)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>gardening, garden</div><b>κηπουρός</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine or feminine (plural κηπουροί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>gardener</div><b>κηρήθρα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural κηρήθρες)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>honeycomb</div><b>κηρίο</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural κηρία)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>candela (the SI unit quantifying luminous intensity)</div><b>κηροπήγιο</b>
