  <div class='def'>candlestick, candle holder</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Katharevousa κηροπήγιον, from Ancient Greek κηρός + πήγνυμι + suffix -ιον (-ion), with modern suffix -ιο (-io).</div><b>κηρύθρα</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (plural κηρύθρες)</i></div>
