  <div class='def'>(uncountable) kinesthesia, kinaesthesia</div><b>κινδυνεύω</b>
  <div><i>verb</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (intransitive) to be in danger, to be in peril, to be at risk</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (intransitive) to be in danger, to risk, to run the risk</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from Ancient Greek κινδυνεύω.</div><b>κινεζικά</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter plural</i></div>
  <div class='def'>Chinese (the language of China its people)</div>
