  <div class='def'>5. cinema, movie theater (a building where movies are shown to an audience)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learned borrowing from French cinématographe. By surface analysis, κίνημα + -γράφος.</div><b>κινηματογραφία</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) cinematography, film</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from French cinématographie.</div><b>κινηματογραφικός</b>
