  <div class='def'>mobile, mobile phone (UK), cell phone (US)</div><b>κινητό τηλέφωνο</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (plural κινητά τηλέφωνα)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>mobile, mobile phone (UK), cell phone (US)</div><b>κινητός</b>
