  <div class='ex'>ΑΥΤΟΣ
ο κόσμος ο μικρός, ο μέγας!
AFTOS
o kósmos o mikrós, o mégas!
THIS
the small world, the great!
The Collected Poems of Odysseus Elytis @books.google</div>
