  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural μηχανισμοί)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. mechanism</div>
  <div class='def'>2. machine</div><b>μηχανολόγος</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine or feminine (plural μηχανολόγοι)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>engineer</div><b>μηχανοποίητος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine μηχανοποίητη, neuter μηχανοποίητο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>machine-made</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Learnedly from μηχανή + -ο- (-o-) + -ποίητος.</div><b>μι</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter (indeclinable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. (indeclinable) mu, the 12th letter of the modern Greek alphabet.</div>
  <div class='def'>2. (indeclinable) mi</div>
