  <div><i>phrase</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(idiomatic) was scared stiff, was terrified, was scared shitless</div>
  <div class='ex'>Όταν είδα το λιοντάρι μπροστά μου, <b>μου κόπηκαν τα ήπατα</b>! - When I saw the lion in front of me, I was terrified!</div><b>μουγκρίζω</b>
