  <div class='def'>a dark-colored stain (particularly from coal or ink)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Byzantine Greek μουντζούρα / μουτζούρα․ Related to Middle Armenian մոծիր (mocir), մոծեր (mocer), dialectal Armenian մճիր, and Ottoman Turkish موجور. The nature of the relationship and the ultimate origin are uncertain.</div><b>μουντιάλ</b>
