  <div class='def'>2. (colloquial, offensive, vulgar) cunt, shit, fucker, prick, dickhead, asshole, douchebag (extremely unpleasant or objectionable person)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Είδες τι έκανε στο αμάξι μου το <b>μουνόπανο</b>; - Did you see what that cunt did to my car?</div>
