  <div class='def'>1. rough shark (Oxynotus-genus shark)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. rough shark (Oxynotus-genus shark); Especially, the angular roughshark. (Oxynotus centrina)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from translingual Oxynotus.</div><b>οξύς</b>
