  <div class='ex'><b>Οπ</b>! Τι έγινε εδώ; - Oops! What happened here?</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Onomatopoeic from Turkish hop (“go on! jump!”)</div><b>οπ αρτ</b>
  <div><i>noun, feminine (uncountable)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(uncountable) op art</div>
