  <div class='def'>1. soldier (not a commissioned officer)</div>
  <div class='def'>2. hoplite (a heavily-armed infantryman of Ancient Greece)</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ὁπλίτης.</div><b>οπληφόρος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine οπληφόρα, neuter οπληφόρο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>ungulate, hooved, hoofed</div><b>οπλισμένο σκυρόδεμα</b>
  <div><i>noun, neuter</i></div>
