  <div class='def'>(indeclinable) hitchhiking</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Borrowed from French autostop.</div><b>ου</b>
  <div><i>intj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>1. Expresses contempt</div>
  <div class='ex'><b>Ου</b> να χαθείς! - Get lost!</div>
  <div class='def'>2. wow, ooh (expresses wonder or surprise)</div>
  <div class='ex'><b>Ου</b> τι ωραίο σπίτι! - Ooh, what a lovely house!</div>
  <div class='def'>3. Expresses affirmation, in place of of course or certainly</div>
  <div class='ex'>Έφυγε ακόμα; <b>Ου</b>, τώρα! - Has he left? Of course, by now!</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> Onomatopoeic.</div><b>ουάου</b>
  <div><i>intj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>wow! denotes amazement</div>
