  <div><i>adj</i></div>
  <div class='def'>nominative/accusative/vocative neuter plural of <a href="bword://ταυτόχρονος">ταυτόχρονος</a></div><b>ταυτόχρονος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine ταυτόχρονη, neuter ταυτόχρονο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>simultaneous</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> From Ancient Greek ταὐτός + χρόνος.</div><b>ταφή</b>
