  <br/><br/>
  <div><i>adv</i></div>
  <div class='def'>(colloquial, derogatory, humorous, sometimes) in the wintertime, in the winter (usually with reference to something not appropriate or usual for the season)</div>
  <div class='ex'>Κάνει μπάνιο <b>χειμωνιάτικα</b>· είναι χειμερινός κολυμβητής. - He goes swimming in winterime; he is a winter swimmer</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> χειμών(ας) (“winter”) + -ιάτικα.</div><b>χειμωνιάτικος</b>
  <div><i>adj, masculine (feminine χειμωνιάτικη, neuter χειμωνιάτικο)</i></div>
  <div class='def'>wintry, winter, winter- (occurring during, suitable for or typical of the season of winter)</div>
  <div class='ex'><b>χειμωνιάτικο</b> κρύο - wintry cold</div>
  <div class='etym'><b>Etymology:</b> χειμώνας + -ιάτικος.</div><b>χειμώνας</b>
  <div><i>noun, masculine (plural χειμώνες)</i></div>
